*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0009
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-07-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 428
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0009.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> LATE PAYMENTS IN LAST 12 MONTHS
    05 LATE-PMTS-YR       PIC 9(2).
    *> DAYS PAYMENT IS LATE
    05 DPD-DAYS           PIC 9(3).
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 ACCOUNT-STAT       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    05 PENALTY-AMT        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM REPEAT-OFFENDER
    PERFORM COLLECTIONS-CHECK
    DISPLAY "ACCOUNT-STAT=" ACCOUNT-STAT
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-AMT=" PENALTY-AMT
    STOP RUN.
REPEAT-OFFENDER.
    *> REPEAT LATE PAYER SUSPENSION
    IF LATE-PMTS-YR >= 4 AND DPD-DAYS > 45
        MOVE 'S' TO ACCOUNT-STAT
        ADD 100 TO PENALTY-AMT
    END-IF.
COLLECTIONS-CHECK.
    IF DPD-DAYS > 60
        MOVE 'C' TO ACCOUNT-STAT
    END-IF.
